        <detaileddescription>
<para>Securely wipes all cached key material using OPENSSL_cleanse before releasing memory. This destructor is guaranteed to be called when the instance is destroyed, even in exception scenarios (due to RAII).</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>Thread-safe: Safe to destroy from any thread </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="warning"><para>Do not access cache after destructor has been called </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
